        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Do you offer same-day hair extension installations?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes, same-day hair extension installations may be available on days our salon is open, subject to appointment availability. Luxe Aura Hair carries over 80 hair extension colours in stock, allowing clients to explore different shades and extension methods without necessarily needing to pre-order hair. You can schedule a consultation to discuss your preferred method, select a suitable colour, and check whether installation can be completed during the same visit. To confirm same-day availability, call us at (212) 221-3881 or book online at https://luxeaurahair.com/book-now."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Can you help clients with hair loss, alopecia, or post-chemo regrowth?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Absolutely, and it is one of the areas Luxe Aura Hair is most experienced and most passionate about. The team specialises in working with clients who are recovering from chemotherapy, managing alopecia, or dealing with significant hair thinning or loss. We work with as little as three to four inches of regrowth and use the gentlest, most appropriate methods for each client's specific stage and hair condition. Every appointment of this kind begins with a free, confidential consultation so we can assess your hair properly and create a plan that works for you."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How do I get started at Luxe Aura Hair?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "The best first step is booking a consultation, either in person at our Greenwich Village salon or by phone. During the consultation, one of our specialists will assess your hair, talk through your goals, explain which methods are best suited to your hair type, and give you a full, transparent quote with no surprises. There is zero obligation to book after the consultation, but most clients do, because once you understand exactly what is possible, it is hard not to be excited. You can book at https://luxeaurahair.com/book-now or call us at (212) 221-3881. We look forward to meeting you."
          }
        }
